    "hero_label": "Our story",
    "hero_title": "Every fragrance tells a story.",
    "hero_subtitle": "Every story is unique.",
    "story_title": "Born from Passion",
    "story_text_1": "Perrotta Fragrances emerged from a deep admiration for the art of perfumery — a form of expression that transcends cultures, eras, and memories. Founded with the purpose of democratizing access to the world's great olfactory creations, the brand rigorously selects each fragrance that enters its portfolio.",
    "story_text_2": "We believe a perfume is not just an accessory. It is an extension of your identity, an invitation to the world about who you are — and who you want to be. That is why every product that reaches you has gone through a rigorous curation process, ensuring authenticity, quality, and the experience you deserve.",
    "mission_title": "Our Mission",
    "mission_text": "To connect people with the fragrances that express their essence, with excellence in service, 100% original products, and the delivery of an accessible luxury experience.",
